    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1aWVrLUJKMnNidGY1VTBYeDdUOGJQN255STgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 病房学校老师带着金句向我们走来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f83d546884ccbb19312235</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f83d546884ccbb19312235</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Sep 2023 08:50:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在病房当老师是种怎样的体验？面对混龄儿童要如何备课？在病房工作更偏爱哪些图画书？这次我们请到了鹿飞老师来播客做客，聊一聊病房学校那些事。这期节目上线的时间接近教师节，算是教师节特辑吧~不论的你教学对象是谁，都祝您教师节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的书籍有《我永远爱你》《猜猜我有多爱你》《幼眼看世界系列》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> &nbsp;如何与病房学校项目结缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">9:23</a> &nbsp;对这份工作的想象和现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> &nbsp;浅看一下病房学校老师的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> &nbsp;两个难忘的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3041">50:41</a> &nbsp;为什么病房学校设点比较多在血液科</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3124">52:04</a> &nbsp;这些原来是不对的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">57:24</a> &nbsp;病房学校老师如何自我提升？有哪些渠道可以学习面对生命离别的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3892">1:04:52</a> &nbsp;病房学校老师有哪些工作上的支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4143">1:09:03</a> &nbsp;换个时机接触这份工作会更好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4227">1:10:27</a> &nbsp;从图画书出发讲述的病房中的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4406">1:13:26</a> &nbsp;病房学校老师会推荐什么图画书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4571">1:16:11</a> &nbsp;推荐的三位嘉宾候选人</span></p>]]></description>
